<!--
  CCT-32 Task C.1 — Adaptive launcher icon (Android 8.0+).

  Foreground: waveform-orb glyph (cyan→violet gradient) over the standard
  108dp adaptive canvas. Background: midnight surface anchor (#0A0B10).
  Monochrome variant ships for Android 13+ themed icons.
-->
